sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant R as Resolver
    participant D as devshell kind
    participant B as Backend
    O->>R: resolve(config, backend)
    R-->>O: ordered steps, kinds validated
    O->>O: consent check for steps that run project code
    O->>D: effects(installable, project root)
    D->>D: path-info validity query, no build
    D->>D: print-dev-env and the hook under a sanitised baseline
    D->>D: path-info -r for the store closure
    D-->>O: environment, grants and written file
    O->>O: create branch and stage workspace
    O->>B: create(request with steps and effects)
    B-->>O: record
    O->>O: persist the record and its effects
